  &lt;body>
    &lt;p>
&lt;b>The SKOS mapping relations and their relationships to the profile elements implemented by SKOS&amp;#160;for MBOE&lt;/b>

    &lt;/p>

    &lt;p>
Mapping relations are used to show semantic relations between vocabularies. Semantic relations that are used for relations within the same SKOS-based&amp;#160;vocabulary are not shown.

    &lt;/p>

    &lt;p>
For the full set of SKOS&amp;#160;semantic relations see: &lt;a href="mdel://_19_0_4_c480314_1690291178165_921277_12645" erit:display="NAME" erit:update="AUTOMATIC_UPDATE">SKOS Metamodel - Per RDF classes and associations (with class and association annotations)&lt;/a>

    &lt;/p>

    &lt;p>
For class attributes of classes imported from the &lt;a href="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#">skos.rdf&lt;/a> see &lt;a href="mdel://_19_0_4_c480314_1688568161448_562908_10716" erit:display="NAME" erit:update="AUTOMATIC_UPDATE">SKOS Metamodel - Per RDF classes only (with attribute annotations)&lt;/a>.

    &lt;/p>

    &lt;p>
&amp;#160;

    &lt;/p>

    &lt;p>
Note that the realization arrows on this diagram show traceability to relationships between Concept and Thing, but the profile implements these as reflexive relationships from &lt;a href="mdel://_19_0_4_c480314_1686253385811_877770_6537" erit:display="NAME" erit:update="AUTOMATIC_UPDATE">MVF entry&lt;/a> (equivalent to &lt;a href="mdel://_19_0_4_c480314_1688572993573_29464_10957" erit:display="CUSTOM_TEXT" erit:update="NO_UPDATE">Concept&lt;/a>) through inheritance from &lt;a href="mdel://_19_0_4_c480314_1686242562734_318983_5865" erit:display="NAME" erit:update="AUTOMATIC_UPDATE">&lt;i>mboeMappingRelation&lt;/i>&lt;/a> (see diagram &lt;a href="mdel://_19_0_4_c480314_1690195659329_306056_11171" erit:display="NAME" erit:update="AUTOMATIC_UPDATE">mappingRelation - Top levels&lt;/a>. This is because the imported &lt;a href="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core">skos/core&lt;/a> ontology does not correctly render these as reflexive relationships from Concept to Concept. For more detail on this issue, see &lt;a href="mdel://_19_0_4_c480314_1690356181062_866625_11199" erit:display="NAME" erit:update="AUTOMATIC_UPDATE">SKOS Metamodel - Per RDF classes and associations (no annotations)&lt;/a>.

    &lt;/p>

